    \If{SDT}{
        Calculate the spike firing rate of each layer, $SFR_{SDT}$ \\
    }
    \If{TET}{
        Calculate the spike firing rate of each layer, $SFR_{TET}$ \\
    }

    Fine-tune the model at timesteps $T_{de}$ \\ 
    Calculate test accuracy and save the best model $W_2$ 
