Quantum-enhanced industrial automation promises a paradigm shift in manufacturing through unprecedented precision, security, and intelligence levels. Integrating quantum communication, sensing, and computation technologies into industrial workflows can strengthen system resilience and usher in Industry 5.0 and 6.0 capabilities.

