As financial transactions scale across decentralized and multi-jurisdictional systems, quantum communication technologies offer critical innovations for securing, optimizing, and regulating cross-border digital finance. Integrating QKD into transaction APIs, blockchain verification, and high-frequency trading protocols can mitigate the risks of quantum adversaries in the fintech ecosystem.

