\subsection{Adv-BMT}
\label{subsec: Adv-BMT}
The overview of Adv-BMT is illustrated in Fig.\ref{fig:Adv-BMT_Overview}. The framework mainly consists of three steps: (1) it adds an adversarial agent (ADV) with a specified collision state into the current scenario; (2) it predicts reversely for the adversarial trajectory; (3) it performs rule-based checks and reject physically implausible ones.


