\paragraph{Quantitative Results}
To evaluate the impact of adversarial training using Adv-BMT-generated scenarios, we assess policy performance across two distinct validation environments:  
(1) {100 Waymo Validation Environments}, which consist of unmodified real-world driving scenarios from WOMD validation set, and   
(2) {100 Adv-BMT Environments}, which is the augmented collision scenarios from the 100 validation scenes. Table~\ref{tab:open-loop_results} presents the evaluation results, demonstrating how training with Adv-BMT improves policy resilience in both standard and adversarial settings. A detailed analysis of these results follows in the subsequent sections.


