\section{Conclusion}

This paper integrates the dynamic vocabulary-based CB method with OWSM v3.1, freezing the pre-trained parameters to enable effective CB even with a small dataset, while preserving the advantages of SFMs. 
The proposed method improves the B-WER by 11.6 points, resulting in a 0.9 point improvement in the overall WER while reducing the RTF by 7.5\% compared to OWSM v3.1 on the LibriSpeech 100 test-clean set.

