	\begin{proposition}[Intermediate Node and Constant Voltage Source]\label{pro:lianjie}
		The intermediate node in Example \ref{eg:c5-lianjie} and the constant voltage source in Example \ref{eg:c5-constV} are $delta$-D($X,\rr^2$) for any $X$ with $Q\succeq0$.
