Then, with the objective of maximizing $\mathcal{U}_{Sys}$, we formulate a long-term optimization problem to jointly and dynamically determine partial-DT assignments $x_{c,b}(t)$, ES-sensor associations $y_{b,n}(t)$, subcarrier allocations $z_{b,n,w}(t)$ and training rounds $T_b(t)$ in every time frame $t$, denoted as $\Pi_{Sys}$ $=\big\{x_{c,b}(t), y_{b,n}(t), z_{b,n,w}(t), T_b(t)\big\}_{\forall t,c,b,w}$, which is given bellow.
