\section{A Game-Theoretic Approach with Two-sided Matching and Overlapping Coalitions}\label{Solu}
In this section, we first transform the original problem $[\mathcal{P}_{1}]$ into a more tractable two-layer hierarchical game consisting of a two-sided matching game and an overlapping coalition formation game. Then, we analyze these games in detail and propose a DRL-based solution to obtain the corresponding equilibrium in an online manner.
