Specifically, we divide clients' resource capacities $\{c_i\}_{i=1}^n$ into $k$ levels, $\{c_1, c_2, \dots, c_k\}$ in an ascending order. Each level $c_h, h\in[k]$ indicates the number of LoRA layers a client can train. 
