We now wish to bound the right-hand side of above displayed inequality by known data. Multiply the equations \eqref{um}, \eqref{thetam}, and \eqref{pm} by ${{\rm d}_m^k}''(t),{\eta_m^k}'(t)$ and ${{\rm l}_m^k}'(t)$, respectively.
