 &\qquad
 +\Big(\frac{a_1+|\gamma|/\gamma_0}{a_1-|\gamma|/\gamma_0}+\frac{a_2+|\gamma|\gamma_0}{a_2-|\gamma|\gamma_0}\Big)\Big[
