 &\qquad\qquad\qquad\qquad
 +\frac{3}{a_2-|\gamma|\gamma_0}\big(\beta^2\norm{  u^{*0}}^2_{H^2(\Omega)}+\kappa^2\norm{p^0}^2_{H^2(\Omega)} +\norm{g(0)}^2\big) \nonumber \\
