\begin{rem}[Identities]
  Before proceeding further, we state the following identities, which lead to telescopic sums and are used in Theorem~\ref{p2;stability-thm} and Theorem~\ref{error-estimates thm}. For any discrete functions $Q^n \in V_h$ and $S^n \in W_h$, $n=0,1,2,\cdots,N$ there hold
\begin{subequations}
\begin{align}
