Let us define $\rho_\varepsilon (s)=\varepsilon^{-1} \rho(\varepsilon^{-1}s)$ for $\varepsilon >0$, where $\rho(t)$ is a function in $C_0^{\infty}(\mathbb{R})$ satisfying
