\caption{
(a) Comparison of traditional knowledge distillation from LLM to SLM, and our flipping knowledge distillation of domain-specific expertise from SLM to LLM.
(b) In the representation space, when texts are highly similar but semantically unrelated, the LLM learns the correct semantic distance between them through distillation from the SLM, which provides more accurate knowledge.
}
\label{fig:intro}
